  "next_gate": "Test whether the existing registered-action apparatus already contains the four primitives required by this witness: additive accumulation, a normalized unit closure boundary, integer receipt emission, and retained bounded residual. If those primitives are native, test exact identification with the Audit005 spectral weight rather than inventing a new frequency law.",
